{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02506","headline":"游灵山寺 · 刘孝孙","name":"游灵山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾王游胜地，骖驾历祗园。\n临风画角愤，耀日采旗翻。\n永怀筌了义，寂念啓玄门。\n深谿穷地脉，高嶂接云根。\n信美谐心赏，幽邃且攀援。\n曳裾欣扈从，方悟屏尘諠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘孝孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}